# This project's sources are written on Windows and one large file
# (crates/rubrica-app/src/view.rs) is stored with CRLF line endings. A CR
# before the LF is a line ending there, not trailing whitespace, so tell the
# whitespace rules that; `git diff --check` then stays a meaningful signal
# instead of flagging every added line of that file.
*.rs whitespace=cr-at-eol
